			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I love the future of the web that's being built, such a richer and more colorful path. FWIW, I think the panel discussion communicated this idea without you even having to spell it out.</p>",
